    <h1>About Minepedia</h1>
    <p>Minepedia is an independent, fan-made Minecraft knowledge base. It collects practical, verified information - guides, crafting recipes, commands, enchantments, mobs, potions, biomes, structures, seeds and tools - in one fast, searchable site, with the differences between Java and Bedrock Edition always called out.</p>
    <h2>How content is made</h2>
    <p>Every page is researched against the official Minecraft Wiki (minecraft.wiki) and the game's current version, and the site is checked regularly for broken links and outdated facts. When mechanics differ between editions, we say so on the page instead of guessing.</p>
    <h2>Independence</h2>
    <p>Minepedia is a fan resource. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Mojang Studios, Mojang Synergies AB or Microsoft. "Minecraft" is a trademark of Mojang Synergies AB. All artwork on this site is original and made for Minepedia - we do not use Mojang's game assets, screenshots or logos.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Spot an error or have a suggestion? Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
